    "answer": {
      "short": "$a=5,\\quad b=-3,\\quad c=4$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}a&=-5\\times(-1)=5\\\\15&=-5b\\\\b&=-3\\\\-20&=-5c\\\\c&=4\\end{aligned}$$",
